            <ArticleTitle>Work restrictions: documenting a patient's return to work.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>49-53</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/01.NPR.0000388901.49604.a8</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Patients frequently ask NPs to write work restrictions, even if it is not in their best interest. This article helps providers construct valid work restrictions and addresses specific tasks and issues to keep the patient and coworkers safe when returning to work.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
